@backend = http://127.0.0.1:8087

### Catalog counts and topic readiness
GET {{backend}}/api/books/summary

### Get actual topic IDs instead of assuming topic IDs on a fresh DB
GET {{backend}}/api/topics

### All 471 canonical books (stable DB ID order)
GET {{backend}}/api/books?page=0&size=100

### Second page
GET {{backend}}/api/books?page=1&size=100

### LA ID is 2 only in this recorded local database
GET {{backend}}/api/books?topicId=2&page=0&size=100
